### COMPREHENSIVE THIRD-PARTY ATTRIBUTION AND CREDITS

This software incorporates open-source software packages, open datasets, and web fonts. Full attribution is extended to their respective authors and maintainers:

#### 1. Open Data Datasets
- **disposable-email-domains/disposable-email-domains**: Maintained by Dustin T. Cox & community (MIT / CC0 License).
- **ivolo/disposable-email-domains**: Maintained by Ivolo & community (MIT License).
- **wesbos/burner-email-providers**: Maintained by Wes Bos & community (MIT License).

#### 2. Core Software Frameworks, High-Performance Engines & Libraries
- **FastAPI**: Created by Sebastián Ramírez / Tiangolo (MIT License).
- **Pydantic**: Maintained by Samuel Colvin & Pydantic Services Inc. (MIT License).
- **Granian**: Rust-backed HTTP/ASGI Server created by Emmett Framework team (BSD 3-Clause / MIT License).
- **MessagePack (`msgpack`)**: Binary serialization format & library by Sadayuki Furuhashi & community (Apache 2.0 License).
- **zstandard (`python-zstandard`)**: Fast C-native Zstandard compression by Meta / Facebook & Gregory Szorc (BSD 3-Clause / GPLv2 License).
- **Model Context Protocol (`mcp`)**: Open protocol and SDK for AI Agent tools by Anthropic & community (MIT License).
- **tiktoken**: Fast BPE tokenizer library for OpenAI LLMs by OpenAI (MIT License).
- **orjson**: Fast, Rust-backed JSON library for Python created by ijl (Apache 2.0 / MIT License).
- **RapidFuzz**: Rapid C++ Levenshtein distance & string matching library by Max Bachmann (MIT License).
- **hiredis**: C extension parser for Redis protocol maintained by Redis Inc. (BSD 3-Clause License).
- **Uvicorn & Gunicorn**: Maintained by Encode & Gunicorn team (BSD / MIT License).
- **dnspython**: Created by Bob Halley & contributors (ISC License).
- **aiobreaker**: Asynchronous Circuit Breaker library (BSD License).
- **redis-py**: Maintained by Redis Inc. & community (MIT License).
- **structlog**: Created by Hynek Schlawack (Apache 2.0 / MIT License).
- **argon2-cffi**: Maintained by Hynek Schlawack & Argon2 team (MIT License).
- **pybloom-live & bitarray**: Bloom Filter implementation & bitset array (MIT / PSF License).
- **prometheus_client**: Maintained by Prometheus Authors (Apache 2.0 License).
- **httpx**: Maintained by Encode team (BSD 3-Clause License).

#### 3. Typography & UI Design Assets
- **Outfit Font Family**: Designed by Onfray & Google Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1).
- **JetBrains Mono Font Family**: Designed by JetBrains & Google Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1).
